        {
          "packet": 11,
          "field": "ftp.request.command",
          "value": "RETR"
        },
        {
          "packet": 11,
          "field": "ftp.request.arg",
          "value": "/data.bin"
        },
        {
          "packet": 12,
          "field": "ftp.response.code",
          "value": "150"
        },
        {
          "packet": 13,
          "field": "tcp.dstport",
          "value": "49993"
        },
        {
          "packet": 21,
          "field": "ftp.response.code",
          "value": "226"
        },
        {
          "packet": 22,
          "field": "ftp.request.command",
          "value": "QUIT"
        },
        {
          "packet": 23,
          "field": "ftp.response.code",
          "value": "221"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "链化（Task 6）：PASV port=195*256+73=49993；控制 18（3hs+banner+5×2+空cmd 1+4teardown@21-24…实为 3hs+banner+PASV/RETR 等 4 命名 cmd×2 + 空 cmd 响应 1 + 4teardown=18）+ 数据 9（3hs+PSH+ACK+4teardown）+ 数据后控制 226/QUIT/221 6 包 = 27；数据 SYN@13（Task 1 per-conn dst）"
      ]
    }
