  {
    "id": "ftp_sessions_dual",
    "proto": "ftp",
    "summary": "T-FTP-2 sessions: 双会话（RETR+LIST，层链），独立 TCP 连接、独立数据通道",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {
          "ip": {
            "src": "10.0.0.1",
            "dst": "20.0.0.1"
          }
        },
        {
          "tcp": {
            "src_port": 21000,
            "dst_port": 21
          }
        },
        {
          "ftp": {
            "sessions": [
              {
                "src_port": 20000,
                "banner": "220 s1",
                "transactions": [
                  {
                    "commands": [
                      {
                        "cmd": "USER anonymous",
                        "response": "331"
                      },
                      {
                        "cmd": "PASV",
                        "response": "227 Entering Passive Mode (20,0,0,1,195,73)"
                      },
                      {
                        "cmd": "RETR /a.bin",
                        "response": "150",
                        "emit_data_channel": true
                      },
                      {
                        "cmd": "",
                        "response": "226 done"
                      }
                    ],
                    "data_channel": {
                      "payload": "FILE-A"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "src_port": 20001,
                "banner": "220 s2",
                "transactions": [
                  {
                    "commands": [
                      {
                        "cmd": "CWD /pub",
                        "response": "250"
                      },
                      {
                        "cmd": "PASV",
                        "response": "227 Entering Passive Mode (20,0,0,1,195,74)"
                      },
                      {
                        "cmd": "LIST",
                        "response": "150",
                        "emit_data_channel": true
                      },
                      {
                        "cmd": "",
                        "response": "226 done"
                      }
                    ],
                    "data_channel": {
                      "payload": "DIR-LIST"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "expect": {
      "min_packets": 46,
      "packet_count": 46,
      "negotiated": true,
      "terminates": true,
      "has_handshake": true,
      "has_payload": true,
      "fields": [
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "tcp.srcport",
          "value": "20000"
        },
        {
          "packet": 24,
          "field": "tcp.srcport",
          "value": "20001"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "链化（Task 6）：每会话 23 帧 = 控制 14（3hs+banner+3cmd×2+空cmd 1+流内挥手 4）+ 数据通道 9；会话1 数据口 195*256+73=49993，会话2 195*256+74=49994；会话挥手经 CloseConn 流内拆除（concurrent 模式），流末不再重复挥手——较 legacy 48 帧少 2 帧（末连接挥手去重），独立序号/握手/挥手保持"
      ]
    }
  },
